— gated off on misalign.\ncores/bench/rtl/mem_stage.sv:96:    dmem_addr  = in.alu_result;\ncores/bench/rtl/mem_stage.sv:97:    dmem_wdata = wdata_rep;\ncores/bench/rtl/mem_stage.sv:98:    dmem_wen   = (in.ctrl.mem_write && !mem_misalign) ? byte_mask : 4'b0000;\ncores/bench/rtl/mem_stage.sv:99:\n…[5875 of 8947 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:d258d922010ed303]…\n41:  output logic        io_dmemREn,\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:42:  // dmem bus backpressure. Drive 1 for zero-wait. Drive 0 to model\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:46:  input  logic        io_dmemReady,\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:154:  mem_stage u_mem (\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:159:    .dmem_addr  (io_dmemAddr),\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:160:    .dmem_wdata (io_dmemWData),\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:161:    .dmem_rdata (io_dmemRData),\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:162:    .dmem_wen   (io_dmemWEn),\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:163:    .dmem_ren   (io_dmemREn),\ncores/bench/rtl/core.sv:183:    .dmem_ready     (io_dmemReady),\ncores/bench/rtl/reg_file.sv:13:// fine here; explicit BRAM attribution lives on the larger imem/dmem\ncores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv:19:  input  logic               stall,         // freeze EX/MEM register (dmem stall)\ncores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv:176:      // dmem stall: hold the EX/MEM register so the in-flight LOAD/STORE\ncores/bench/rtl/if_stage.sv:38:  // redirect on the same cycle as imem_stall or dmem_stall — without\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
