{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The existing design already carries `valid` through the pipe, but invalid decoded load/store bits could still leak into MEM outputs and forwarding metadata. I’m going to keep raw fetch bits on squash, then canonicalize invalid ID/EX payloads and add MEM-side valid gating as a belt-and-suspenders guard."}}
