{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The core is the single-issue `nret: 1` flavor, with a combinational IF payload and the PC register in `if_stage`. I’m going to keep that timing model: the cache is tiny registered state, IF just does two tag compares and carries the chosen prediction along."}}
