ive divide/remainder operations.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the EX-stage divide stall into the hazard unit without changing the top-level core IO or the nret=1 RVFI contract.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
