tyle cases from the broad one-cycle side ALU or demote them to non-critical defaults, leaving logic, shifts, comparisons, and one-cycle multiply variants off the add/address cone.\"\n  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"If needed, add a compact decoded result-select or add-sub flag to ctrl_t so EX can choose the fast path without re-decoding the full ALU opcode on the critical data path.\"\n  - file: rtl/00_core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Mirror any ctrl_t encoding change for alphabetic build flows that compile this guarded shim before core_pkg.sv.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
