core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Extend the EX1/EX2 payload with registered branch condition, branch target, jump target, and misalignment metadata while retaining the existing rs1/rs2 values for RVFI and divider/store use.\"\n  - file: rtl/00_core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Mirror the new EX1/EX2 branch-resolve metadata fields in the alphabetical build-order shim.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Compute branch compare results and branch/jump targets in EX1 from the forwarded operands, latch them, and drive EX2 redirect/trap logic from the registered metadata.\"\n  - file: test/test_branch_retime.py\n    description: \"Add focused cocotb coverage for taken/not-taken branches, JAL, JALR low-bit clearing, and misaligned control-transfer traps across the new retimed metadata.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
