0\", \"title\": \"Dedicated load-store address adder\", \"category\": \"micro_opt\", \"motivation\": \"After DIV/REM moved out of the combinational ALU, the remaining best-known\\ntiming path is much shorter but still runs from the ID/regfile side through\\nEX and the ALU into the data-memory address path. CoreMark has frequent\\nloads and stores, so the effective-\n…[119976 of 123048 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:e04dec37bca7ea17]…\noutcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 149.8, \"delta_pct\": -10.85, \"vs_baseline\": 1135.97, \"fmax_mhz\": 81.611, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 5448155, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2684, \"ff\": 885, \"seeds\": [79.892, 81.611, 81.611], \"perturbations\": [[0, 79.892, 13], [1, 81.611, 13], [2, 81.611, 13]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/ex1_q.branch_misalign_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -7.517, \"arrival_ns\": 17.811, \"logic_cells\": 40, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-04T05:32:47.633022Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 14, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-04 hyp-20261004-003-r14s2 (regression, -10.85%): Extending DIV/REM predecode to `div_signed`/`div_wants_remainder` widened `ctrl_t` and divider-control fanout more than it saved inside `iter_divider`, so cold op decode removal is not worth extra ID/EX payload bits on the global stall path.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
