/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\tcpu/u_if/pc_13_s1\t19\nhyp-20261004-003-r4s2\tpredictor\tTiny return-stack predictor\tregression\t91.05\t40.771\t4478102\tcpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s\tcpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs1_val_18_s1\t23\nhyp-20261004-001-r5s0\tmicro_opt\tSingle shared multiplier datapath\tregression\t107.93\t48.481\t4491817\tcpu/u_mem/reg_q.rd_0_s0\tcpu/u_if/pc_27_s1\t21\nhyp-20261004-003-r5s2\tpredictor\tTwo-entry loop target cache\tregression\t89.94\t38.633\t4295401\tcpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\tcpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs2_val_7_s1\t26\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
