or RAM-port muxing.\nexpected_impact:\n  fitness_delta_pct: 6\n  confidence: medium\nchanges:\n  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n    description: \"Stop muxing ADDI x0,x0,0 onto out.instr for flush or redirect; keep redirect-priority PC update but make squashes affect only out.valid.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"When IF/ID valid is low, latch a canonical side-effect-free ID/EX bubble while keeping regfile read-address selection independent of redirect and flush-driven valid kills.\"\n  - file: rtl/mem_stage.sv\n    description: \"Optionally harden dmem_ren and dmem_wen with the EX/MEM valid bit so invalid bubbles can never drive memory side effects if a future decode change forgets to zero controls.\"\n  - file: test/test_valid_squash.py\n    description: \"Add focused cocotb coverage for taken-branch and imem-stall squashes where the raw wrong-path instruction looks like a load/store or writer, ensuring it does not execute or retire.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
