l/00_core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Mirror the EX1/EX2 bundle shape change in the alphabetical build-order shim.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Stop computing target-misalignment flags in EX1 from live forwarded operands; compute misalign_fault in EX2 from registered branch_cond, branch_target, jump_target, and control bits, preserving redirect suppression and trap behavior.\"\n  - file: test/test_aligned_target_predictor.py\n    description: \"Add focused coverage for taken misaligned branches, not-taken misaligned branch targets, misaligned JAL/JALR traps, and aligned control-flow behavior under stalls.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
