   description: \"Predecode only direct branch/JAL opcodes, compute static backward/JAL predicted next PC, and select it over pc+4 when not stalled or recovering.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Latch the prediction metadata alongside the decoded instruction without changing decoder legality or RVFI source fields.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Treat redirect as prediction recovery: suppress redirects for correctly predicted direct JAL/backward branches, redirect to pc+4 on predicted-taken branch exits, and keep JALR/illegal/misalignment behavior precise.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
